{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Hotkeys provides three Angular APIs for tracking live keyboard state: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectHeldKeys"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectHeldKeyCodes"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectKeyHold"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"injectheldkeys","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectHeldKeys"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { injectHeldKeys } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\n@Component({\n  standalone: true,\n  template: `\n    <div>\n      {{ heldKeys().length > 0 ? heldKeys().join(' + ') : 'No keys held' }}\n    </div>\n  `,\n})\nexport class KeyDisplayComponent {\n  readonly heldKeys = injectHeldKeys()\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"injectheldkeycodes","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectHeldKeyCodes"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { injectHeldKeyCodes } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\nreadonly heldCodes = injectHeldKeyCodes()","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"injectkeyhold","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectKeyHold"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { injectKeyHold } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\nreadonly isShiftHeld = injectKeyHold('Shift')","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"common-patterns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Common patterns"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"hold-to-reveal-ui","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Hold-to-reveal UI"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { injectKeyHold } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\n@Component({\n  standalone: true,\n  template: `\n    @if (isShiftHeld()) {\n      <button>Permanently Delete</button>\n    } @else {\n      <button>Move to Trash</button>\n    }\n  `,\n})\nexport class FileActionsComponent {\n  readonly isShiftHeld = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"debugging-key-display","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Debugging key display"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport {\n  formatForDisplay,\n  injectHeldKeyCodes,\n  injectHeldKeys,\n  type RegisterableHotkey,\n} from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\n@Component({ standalone: true, template: `` })\nexport class KeyDebuggerComponent {\n  readonly heldKeys = injectHeldKeys()\n  readonly heldCodes = injectHeldKeyCodes()\n  readonly formatKey = (k: string) =>\n    formatForDisplay(k as RegisterableHotkey, { useSymbols: true })\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"under-the-hood","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Under the hood"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All three APIs subscribe to the singleton "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"KeyStateTracker"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { getKeyStateTracker } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\nconst tracker = getKeyStateTracker()\ntracker.getHeldKeys()\ntracker.isKeyHeld('Shift')","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"modifier-held-shortcut-hints","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Modifier-held shortcut hints"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectHotkeyHint"},{"type":"text","value":" answers whether held modifiers are relevant to a binding. Keep formatting and badge styling in your component:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly visible = injectHotkeyHint(() => this.binding()) // signal: visible()","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Alt+Shift+[KeyK]"},{"type":"text","value":", holding Alt, Shift, or both reveals the hint. An extra Control hides it; releasing all modifiers or blurring the window hides it. Nonmodifier keys are ignored. AltGraph does not reveal hints. Pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ exact: true }"},{"type":"text","value":" to require all binding modifiers, or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ platform: 'mac' }"},{"type":"text","value":" to resolve Mod explicitly. Supply the same platform used by the registration when overriding detection."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Combine the boolean with the action's enabled state. The helper does not register a shortcut or determine whether its target is focused. The core equivalent is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"matchesHeldModifiers(binding, heldKeys, options)"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"injectheldkeys","text":"injectHeldKeys","level":2},{"id":"injectheldkeycodes","text":"injectHeldKeyCodes","level":2},{"id":"injectkeyhold","text":"injectKeyHold","level":2},{"id":"common-patterns","text":"Common patterns","level":2},{"id":"hold-to-reveal-ui","text":"Hold-to-reveal UI","level":3},{"id":"debugging-key-display","text":"Debugging key display","level":3},{"id":"under-the-hood","text":"Under the hood","level":2},{"id":"modifier-held-shortcut-hints","text":"Modifier-held shortcut hints","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Hotkeys provides three Angular APIs for tracking live keyboard state: `injectHeldKeys`, `injectHeldKeyCodes`, and `injectKeyHold`.\n\n## `injectHeldKeys`\n\n```ts\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { injectHeldKeys } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\n@Component({\n  standalone: true,\n  template: `\n    <div>\n      {{ heldKeys().length > 0 ? heldKeys().join(' + ') : 'No keys held' }}\n    </div>\n  `,\n})\nexport class KeyDisplayComponent {\n  readonly heldKeys = injectHeldKeys()\n}\n```\n\n## `injectHeldKeyCodes`\n\n```ts\nimport { injectHeldKeyCodes } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\nreadonly heldCodes = injectHeldKeyCodes()\n```\n\n## `injectKeyHold`\n\n```ts\nimport { injectKeyHold } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\nreadonly isShiftHeld = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n```\n\n## Common patterns\n\n### Hold-to-reveal UI\n\n```ts\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { injectKeyHold } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\n@Component({\n  standalone: true,\n  template: `\n    @if (isShiftHeld()) {\n      <button>Permanently Delete</button>\n    } @else {\n      <button>Move to Trash</button>\n    }\n  `,\n})\nexport class FileActionsComponent {\n  readonly isShiftHeld = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n}\n```\n\n### Debugging key display\n\n```ts\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport {\n  formatForDisplay,\n  injectHeldKeyCodes,\n  injectHeldKeys,\n  type RegisterableHotkey,\n} from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\n@Component({ standalone: true, template: `` })\nexport class KeyDebuggerComponent {\n  readonly heldKeys = injectHeldKeys()\n  readonly heldCodes = injectHeldKeyCodes()\n  readonly formatKey = (k: string) =>\n    formatForDisplay(k as RegisterableHotkey, { useSymbols: true })\n}\n```\n\n## Under the hood\n\nAll three APIs subscribe to the singleton `KeyStateTracker`:\n\n```ts\nimport { getKeyStateTracker } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\nconst tracker = getKeyStateTracker()\ntracker.getHeldKeys()\ntracker.isKeyHeld('Shift')\n```\n\n## Modifier-held shortcut hints\n\n`injectHotkeyHint` answers whether held modifiers are relevant to a binding. Keep formatting and badge styling in your component:\n\n```ts\nreadonly visible = injectHotkeyHint(() => this.binding()) // signal: visible()\n```\n\nFor `Alt+Shift+[KeyK]`, holding Alt, Shift, or both reveals the hint. An extra Control hides it; releasing all modifiers or blurring the window hides it. Nonmodifier keys are ignored. AltGraph does not reveal hints. Pass `{ exact: true }` to require all binding modifiers, or `{ platform: 'mac' }` to resolve Mod explicitly. Supply the same platform used by the registration when overriding detection.\n\nCombine the boolean with the action's enabled state. The helper does not register a shortcut or determine whether its target is focused. The core equivalent is `matchesHeldModifiers(binding, heldKeys, options)`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Key State Tracking Guide\nid: key-state-tracking\n---\n\nTanStack Hotkeys provides three Angular APIs for tracking live keyboard state: `injectHeldKeys`, `injectHeldKeyCodes`, and `injectKeyHold`.\n\n## `injectHeldKeys`\n\n```ts\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { injectHeldKeys } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\n@Component({\n  standalone: true,\n  template: `\n    <div>\n      {{ heldKeys().length > 0 ? heldKeys().join(' + ') : 'No keys held' }}\n    </div>\n  `,\n})\nexport class KeyDisplayComponent {\n  readonly heldKeys = injectHeldKeys()\n}\n```\n\n## `injectHeldKeyCodes`\n\n```ts\nimport { injectHeldKeyCodes } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\nreadonly heldCodes = injectHeldKeyCodes()\n```\n\n## `injectKeyHold`\n\n```ts\nimport { injectKeyHold } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\nreadonly isShiftHeld = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n```\n\n## Common patterns\n\n### Hold-to-reveal UI\n\n```ts\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { injectKeyHold } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\n@Component({\n  standalone: true,\n  template: `\n    @if (isShiftHeld()) {\n      <button>Permanently Delete</button>\n    } @else {\n      <button>Move to Trash</button>\n    }\n  `,\n})\nexport class FileActionsComponent {\n  readonly isShiftHeld = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n}\n```\n\n### Debugging key display\n\n```ts\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport {\n  formatForDisplay,\n  injectHeldKeyCodes,\n  injectHeldKeys,\n  type RegisterableHotkey,\n} from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\n@Component({ standalone: true, template: `` })\nexport class KeyDebuggerComponent {\n  readonly heldKeys = injectHeldKeys()\n  readonly heldCodes = injectHeldKeyCodes()\n  readonly formatKey = (k: string) =>\n    formatForDisplay(k as RegisterableHotkey, { useSymbols: true })\n}\n```\n\n## Under the hood\n\nAll three APIs subscribe to the singleton `KeyStateTracker`:\n\n```ts\nimport { getKeyStateTracker } from '@tanstack/angular-hotkeys'\n\nconst tracker = getKeyStateTracker()\ntracker.getHeldKeys()\ntracker.isKeyHeld('Shift')\n```\n\n## Modifier-held shortcut hints\n\n`injectHotkeyHint` answers whether held modifiers are relevant to a binding. Keep formatting and badge styling in your component:\n\n```ts\nreadonly visible = injectHotkeyHint(() => this.binding()) // signal: visible()\n```\n\nFor `Alt+Shift+[KeyK]`, holding Alt, Shift, or both reveals the hint. An extra Control hides it; releasing all modifiers or blurring the window hides it. Nonmodifier keys are ignored. AltGraph does not reveal hints. Pass `{ exact: true }` to require all binding modifiers, or `{ platform: 'mac' }` to resolve Mod explicitly. Supply the same platform used by the registration when overriding detection.\n\nCombine the boolean with the action's enabled state. The helper does not register a shortcut or determine whether its target is focused. The core equivalent is `matchesHeldModifiers(binding, heldKeys, options)`.\n"}
